# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The rest of the gorge

step The Slag Pit
  tip The Slag Pit opens in the north of the Cauldron. Incendosaurs swim in its lava pools: pull them to the edge. The secret plans lie on the pit's upper ledge.
  kill 9318 quest 7727.1 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Below ground
  collect 18922 quest 7722.1 @40.5,35.7 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Below ground

step Firewatch Ridge: kill these as you meet them
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip The Dark Iron Lookouts stand on the ridges around the sentry towers south of the Cauldron; about one in ten carries the Lookout's Spyglass.
  tip The Searing Lava Spiders roam the plateaus and lava pools in the south-west of the gorge.
  collect 18960 quest 7728.2 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  kill 5858 quest 7724.1 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead

